{c: Chords: the writer's own chart}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]We won't [Bm]go if You're not [G]with [A]us,
Oh [Bm]God, how we [G]need You
[A]You've been our [Bm]refuge, the one [G]we [A]trust,
Oh [Bm]God, how we [G]believe You
[G]We're learning to rest in You, [A] [Bm] [G]
In all that You [A]say is true
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Your [D]love is [A]constant [G/B]
[G]For[D]ever [A]faithful [G/B]
You pro[G]vide, You're [D]always [A]with us
[G/B]By our [G]side, by our [A]side
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]Your love will [Bm]lead us [G]day by [A]day,
Oh [Bm]God, we long to [G]see You
[A]Through every [Bm]season, in [G]every [A]way,
Oh [Bm]God, we know we [G]need You
[G]We've seen the work of Your hand, [A] [Bm] [G]
In Your grace our [A]rock we stand
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[G]When the [D]music [A]fades, still [Bm]by our side
[G]When we [D]lose our [A]way, still [Bm]by our side
[G]You [D]delight to [A]be [Bm]by our side, by our [A]side
[G]When we've [D]lost our [A]song, still [Bm]by our side
[G]When our [D]strength is [A]gone, still [Bm]by our side
[G]You are [D]always [A]faithful, [Bm]by our [G]side, by our [A]side
{end_of_bridge}

{chorus}

{chorus}
